      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "XDP: eXpress Data Path",
      "source_hash": 14763582488314026033,
      "context_hash": 2239502142386387176,
      "translation": "XDP: eXpress Data Path",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "XDP": "XDP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:31:58.879433Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Kernel bypass at the driver level: BPF programs on the receive fast path",
      "source_hash": 16711782726080308297,
      "context_hash": 91497035936321755,
      "translation": "드라이버 수준의 커널 우회: 수신 빠른 경로의 BPF 프로그램",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF programs": "BPF 프로그램",
        "driver": "드라이버",
        "fast path": "빠른 경로",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:31:58.879434Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What is XDP?",
      "source_hash": 16576186959227190569,
      "context_hash": 1997946039248165436,
      "translation": "XDP란 무엇입니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "XDP": "XDP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:31:58.879434Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "XDP (eXpress Data Path) runs a BPF program at the earliest possible point in the kernel network stack — inside the NIC driver, **before** skb allocation.",
      "source_hash": 2522419855522032376,
      "context_hash": 4205379640930487510,
      "translation": "XDP(eXpress Data Path)는 커널 네트워크 스택에서 가능한 가장 이른 지점, 즉 NIC 드라이버 내부에서 skb 할당 **이전에** BPF 프로그램을 실행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF program": "BPF 프로그램",
        "NIC": "NIC",
        "SKB": "skb",
        "XDP": "XDP",
        "driver": "드라이버",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "network stack": "네트워크 스택"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:31:58.879434Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This achieves near-DPDK speeds while staying in the kernel:",
      "source_hash": 14555804956434909008,
      "context_hash": 18128970453281438097,
      "translation": "이를 통해 커널 안에 머무르면서도 DPDK에 가까운 속도를 달성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:31:58.879434Z",
      "issues": []
    },
